# From "Movement to Locale 2 - Intro Focus 21" (Wave VI - Odyssey, CD3-5).
# Distinct from climb-f15-f21.gws (a bare fifteen-to-twenty-one count):
# this tape counts from twelve and introduces Focus 21 with its own
# imagery -- the white light, the bridge to Locale 2. Assumes F21 already
# reached; doesn't repeat the climb itself, since the app's canonical path
# there is climb-f15-f21.gws.

@segment  movement-to-locale-2
@title    Movement to Locale 2
@levels   F21
@duration ~3m30s

say You're in Focus 21 -- the bridge. A bridge to other reality systems, other dimensions of Locale 2. A bridge that lets you visit, and return, from a realm beyond physical existence.
pause 8
say Relax, and notice the difference in energy here.
pause 6
say Now perceive a bright, shining pattern of white light. Move into it.
pause 8
say Observe. Explore. Experience.
pause 6
say Move through the light now, calmly, and perceive what Locale 2 makes possible.
hold 90
say Notice the difference between where you were and where you are now.
pause 8
